  "bodyTextSnippet": "♟️\nChessAcademy\nLearn, Play,\nSolve & Improve\n\nThe world's first activity-based chess curriculum for students of all levels.\n\n♛\n♞\n♝\n150+\nLESSONS\n2500+\nACTIVITIES\n5\nLEVELS\nWelcome back\n\nSign in to your account to continue\n\n* Username\n* Password\nForgot Password?\nLogin\nDon't have an account? Sign up\nSecure Login\n|\nFree to Start\n|\nAlways On\n✦ PLATFORM FEATURES\nEverything you need to\nmaster chess\n\nA complete learning ecosystem - from beginner to advanced - built for serious students.\n\n📚\nActivity-Based Curriculum\nBuild a strong foundation with the world's first activity-based curriculum (ABC) for chess. 150+ lessons across 5 learning levels, from beginner to advanced.\n2500+ Activities\n🧠\nSmart & Active Learning\nLearn from interactive chess courses on openings, middlegames, endgames, tactics, and strategies. Watch video lessons and solve activities to reinforce learning.\nVideo + Practice\n🏆\nOnline Tournaments\nCompete with other students in online chess tournaments. Play different formats including Swiss, Quad, and Swiss Team to test your skills competitively.\nMulti-format\n🧩\nChess Quizzes\nSolve chess puzzles, MCQs, and fun capture activities. Play against the computer and sharpen your tactical vision with interactive quizzes.\nPuzzles & MCQs\n🏫\nInteractive Classroom\nAttend live online chess classes. Actively participate by answering questions, solving puzzles, and competing on the leaderboard by scoring points.\nLive Classes\n🤝\nPlay with Friends & Bots\nPlay casual games with friends o"
}
